<details class="guide-calling"><summary>Optional: choose your Calling</summary>
<p>A Calling gives your character a small specialty. You can choose now, keep your current Calling, or decide later on Home.</p>
<ul class="calling-introduction"><% for(const key of Object.keys(strategy.callings)) { %><li><strong><%= callingName(key) %></strong> — <%= callingDescription(key) %></li><% } %></ul>
<p>Current Calling: <strong><%= callingName(state.className) %></strong>. Each different Calling costs <strong class="gold"><%= state.calling.changeCost.toLocaleString('en') %> Gold</strong> and starts a seven-day wait. Keeping your current Calling is free.</p>
<% const callingReady=!state.calling.changeReadyAt||Date.parse(state.calling.changeReadyAt)<=Date.parse(state.serverTime);if(!callingReady) { %><p>Next eligible: <time datetime="<%= state.calling.changeReadyAt %>"><%= new Date(state.calling.changeReadyAt).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'UTC'}) %> UTC</time>.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/game/profile/calling" data-calling-form data-current-calling="<%= state.className %>" data-change-ready="<%= callingReady %>" data-change-affordable="<%= state.gold>=state.calling.changeCost %>"><%- include('command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="tutorial"><label for="tutorial-calling-choice">Choose a Calling (optional)</label><select id="tutorial-calling-choice" name="className"><% for(const key of Object.keys(strategy.callings)) { %><option value="<%= key %>"<% if(state.className===key) { %> selected<% } %>><%= callingName(key) %></option><% } %></select><button class="button button-outline" type="submit">Choose Calling</button></form>
<p class="field-hint">Choosing is optional. Next Lesson works without changing Calling or spending gold.</p>
</details>
